        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/skunk/scene_skunk.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 996d4dfd-a4ac-4c82-b4e6-c446a2db7edb).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, Agent 47. \r\rNaomi Harvey, daughter of Councilman Gale Harvey, is hosting a party in an upscale neighborhood. \r\rIntelligence reveals four men are plotting her kidnapping for ransom. Three are outside: two acting as lookouts and one sabotaging water pipes to flood the house as a distraction. Eliminate them and stop the abduction. The fourth target, bodyguard Ramon Schreffler, is secretly involved. Ensure his death appears accidental. Good luck, 47.",
        "GameVersion": "8.24.0.0",
